<title>JAPAN: Oval Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Oval Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.58		vs	    6.43</p>
<p> Operating	  153    million    vs	  189    million</p>
<p> Current	    145    million    vs	  153    million</p>
<p> Net		   67    million    vs	   50    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.58 yen	  vs	    1.93 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  26 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Oval Corp is a large manufacturer of flowmeters.</p>
